{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7258374900907479", "organization": {"id": "152587129447401", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1824496905589740"}]}, "id": "1465553212267804"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "7543986912391867"}]}, "id": "670276812207229"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "9947329485282779"}]}, "id": "656087953622332"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "7258374900907479"}]}, "id": "707418414621787"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "7672407429453449"}]}, "id": "1313978272642084"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "7258374900907479", "release_date": 1771966860, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29277591248559195"}, "id": "1120923545924567"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1785321223, "id": "27865223123129355", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v3", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 2, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "27865230126461988"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "7258374900907479"}, "id": "27865230126461988", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "7258374900907479", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "395723223107031"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27851120884530541", "locale": "cs_CZ", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR CPR", "keywords": ["CPR", "KPR", "ALS", "Prvn\u00ed", "Pomoc"], "long_description": "**N\u00e1cvik resuscitace, kter\u00fd se opravdu ulo\u017e\u00ed do pam\u011bti.**\n\nVR CPR p\u0159en\u00e1\u0161\u00ed tr\u00e9nink KPR z u\u010debny do situace, kdy jde o \u010das. Pro \u0161irokou ve\u0159ejnost i pro profesion\u00e1ly.\n\n# T\u0159i tr\u00e9ninkov\u00e9 linie\n\n- **Ve\u0159ejnost.** Laick\u00e1 KPR: rozpozn\u00e1n\u00ed z\u00e1stavy, p\u0159ivol\u00e1n\u00ed pomoci, stla\u010dov\u00e1n\u00ed, vdechy, AED.\n- **Z\u00e1chran\u00e1\u0159.** Profesion\u00e1ln\u00ed BLS se spr\u00e1vnou technikou, \u010dasov\u00e1n\u00edm a p\u0159ed\u00e1n\u00edm pacienta.\n- **ALS (nov\u011b).** Roz\u0161\u00ed\u0159en\u00e1 resuscitace podle doporu\u010den\u00ed ERC 2025: rytmus, defibrilace, d\u00fdchac\u00ed cesty, l\u00e9ky, role v t\u00fdmu, reverzibiln\u00ed p\u0159\u00ed\u010diny.\n\n# T\u0159i v\u011bkov\u00e9 kategorie\n\nKojenec, d\u00edt\u011b a dosp\u011bl\u00fd. Hloubka stla\u010den\u00ed, poloha rukou i ventilace se s v\u011bkem m\u011bn\u00ed a VR CPR tyhle rozd\u00edly nacvi\u010duje.\n\n# 10 prost\u0159ed\u00ed\n\nResuscitace na JIP vypad\u00e1 jinak ne\u017e u baz\u00e9nu nebo na ulici. Nau\u010d\u00edte se p\u0159izp\u016fsobit prostoru, p\u0159ihl\u00ed\u017eej\u00edc\u00edm i hluku.\n\n# Tr\u00e9nink na jak\u00e9koliv figur\u00edn\u011b\n\nStla\u010dujte hrudn\u00edk doopravdy na figur\u00edn\u011b, kterou u\u017e m\u00e1te. \u017d\u00e1dn\u00fd speci\u00e1ln\u00ed hardware nen\u00ed pot\u0159eba.\n\n# Voliteln\u00fd senzor SimCPR\u00ae\n\nM\u011b\u0159\u00ed hloubku stla\u010den\u00ed, frekvenci a \u00fapln\u00e9 uvoln\u011bn\u00ed hrudn\u00edku, se zp\u011btnou vazbou v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase a objektivn\u00edm hodnocen\u00edm.\n\n# V\u00fdsledky a potvrzen\u00ed\n\nV\u0161e se ukl\u00e1d\u00e1 na na\u0161i webovou platformu: detailn\u00ed vyhodnocen\u00ed, pokrok v \u010dase, \u017eiv\u00e9 sd\u00edlen\u00ed obrazovky s instruktorem a potvrzen\u00ed o absolvov\u00e1n\u00ed.\n\nPro \u0161koly, zdravotnick\u00e1 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, z\u00e1chrann\u00e9 slo\u017eky, firemn\u00ed \u0161kolen\u00ed i ka\u017ed\u00e9ho, kdo chce b\u00fdt p\u0159ipraven\u00fd.", "short_description": "Tr\u00e9nujte KPR ve virtu\u00e1ln\u00ed realit\u011b, od laick\u00e9 resuscitace a\u017e po plnohodnotn\u00e9 ALS podle doporu\u010den\u00ed ERC 2025. Kojenci, d\u011bti i dosp\u011bl\u00ed v 10 prost\u0159ed\u00edch. Voliteln\u00fd senzor SimCPR\u00ae."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "VRCPR_CoverPortrait.png", "id": "1987027791828909", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824532_1987027795162242_3388843381090458704_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eBp954YMn80Q7kNvwHOhVrK&_nc_oc=Adrfhvfrwzc3jR0ofdRF2tZrXyKgJvsIcMn2q4Dca-apiI6pvqkwlRoHn-cX_Q063T4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSx_BA19COnbt0okggHEmIlOzYFzUeo_TZLt9PBvAw-jA&oe=6B0869A7"}, {"file_name": "VRCPR_Icon.png", "id": "1896971667732336", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618240_1896971671065669_4033177573752252150_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6Ld_82Q2dpsQ7kNvwHyYnnB&_nc_oc=Adqv96NdEsJ_gjHsHFfD3xVtAbAnNr2y1FESImEJr094ifcWybItgHHyfB2GD2FJBu4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQnChZw9QFtVbC5RyjwdAqvz7xwZxNapfYjD1CK_eSuSA&oe=6B08650A"}, {"file_name": "VRCPR_HeroCover.png", "id": "1827294898163824", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618294_1827294901497157_2452038408040876112_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HdnvtGpj